<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore expects 1997 inflation to stay low.</title>
<headline>Singapore expects 1997 inflation to stay low.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore expects inflation to average 2.0 to 2.5 percent in 1997, a Ministry of Trade and Industry official said on Friday.</p>
